      "principle": "The burden lies on the party seeking divorce to prove that the other party has not been living with them as a husband/wife for at least three years.",
      "held": "It is settled law that in a petition under Section 13 of the Hindu Marriage Act, the burden lies on the petitioner to prove that the respondent has not been living with him/her as a husband/wife for at least three years.",
